<title>USA: Union Carbide may issue 10-yr capital securities.</title>
<headline>Union Carbide may issue 10-yr capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Carbide Corp is expected to issue $250 million in capital securities one day next week, high-grade syndicate sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a ten-year noncallable maturity, sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available on the deal.</p>
<p>(( --Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
